---
title: Tzatziki
course: Side
source: https://www.bbc.co.uk/food/recipes/baked_falafel_with_09084
prep time: 10m
locale: en
difficulty: easy
cuisine: Egyptian
---

Put the @0% fat plain yoghurt{200%ml} into a small bowl. Squeeze the @cucumber piece{140%g}(grated) to remove excess liquid, then add to the yoghurt with the @garlic{1%clove}(finely grated), @mint leaves{2%tbsp}(finely chopped), @sea salt{pinch}, and @?sweetener{pinch}. Mix well.